# Cloudflare Worker local env template — copy to .dev.vars and
# replace the placeholder values. .dev.vars is gitignored; this
# .example file is committed.
#
# Wrangler reads .dev.vars when you run `npm run dev` and exposes
# each line as a binding inside Env.

# Shared admin token used by the mobile app to gate Worker
# admin reads. Mint a fresh value with:
#   openssl rand -hex 24
# and set the SAME value in:
#   - apps/mobile/.env.production (EXPO_PUBLIC_ATHLETE_MEMORY_TOKEN)
#   - This file (.dev.vars) for local Worker dev
#   - Cloudflare secret for the deployed Worker via:
#       npx wrangler secret put ATHLETE_MEMORY_API_TOKEN --name lauburu-mcp-preview
ATHLETE_MEMORY_API_TOKEN="REPLACE_WITH_REAL_TOKEN"

# Supabase reads are deferred until the connector_* tables in
# docs/CONNECTOR_SUPABASE_SCHEMA.md exist. Leave the values
# unset for now — the Worker handler treats them as
# `supabaseConfigured: false` and returns placeholder payloads
# with explicit `dataSource.schemaRequired` fields.
# When wired (set via `npx wrangler secret put` for the deployed
# Worker; this .dev.vars file is dev-only):
# SUPABASE_URL="https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co"
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY"
